## Project layout

```
src/
  features/[feature]/     # api/, components/, hooks/, screens/, types/, index.ts
  components/             # shared UI (atoms → organisms → templates)
  navigation/             # Application.tsx gate, navigators, paths, types
  theme/                  # tokens, ThemeProvider, useTheme
  services/               # queryClient, sentry<% if (hasAuth) { %>, supabase<% } %>
  store/                  # Zustand stores<% if (hasAuth) { %> (auth)<% } %>
  translations/           # i18n resources
  constants/              # app-wide constants
  utils/                  # pure helpers
```

- Import from `@/` alias (`@/*` → `src/*`). **Never** use deep relative paths across features.
- Import features via their **public** `index.ts` — not internal files.

